{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794319707545,"sessionID":"ses_e3a4b6a66ffe217KTQBOiu6abw","part":{"id":"prt_1c5c9ed90001tlfaZwAvKLOx5M","messageID":"msg_1c5c9cda3001OjZqKolTJV2dIo","sessionID":"ses_e3a4b6a66ffe217KTQBOiu6abw","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794319745602,"sessionID":"ses_e3a4b6a66ffe217KTQBOiu6abw","part":{"id":"prt_1c5c9ef5a001pNypFxwwU2owBM","messageID":"msg_1c5c9cda3001OjZqKolTJV2dIo","sessionID":"ses_e3a4b6a66ffe217KTQBOiu6abw","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a private shared customer directory with authenticated Flask JSON API under `/api`, React/TypeScript frontend, and persistent SQLite storage.\n- Support account registration/login, customer CRUD/search/filter/paging, and shared call/email/meeting interaction logs.\n\n## Important Details\n- Required stack/layout: Python 3.13; `backend/app.py`; `backend/requirements.txt`; Vite project in `frontend/`; `npm run build` outputs `frontend/dist`.\n- Root `Dockerfile` serves Flask and frontend through gunicorn on port 8000; persistent database defaults to `./data/directory.sqlite3`. `DATABASE_PATH` overrides it.\n- All signed-in members may view/change every customer. `GET /api/health` remains public and returns `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`.\n- Authentication uses `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; opaque random tokens have SHA-256 hashes stored in SQLite, expire after 30 days, persist across restarts, and are revoked on logout. Passwords use Werkzeug scrypt hashing.\n- Registration returns 201 without signing in; login returns 200 with `{\"token\": ...}`. Username: trimmed, case-insensitively unique, 3–50 characters; registration password: 8–256 characters.\n- Customer name is required; email/phone/company/notes are optional and empty values become `null`. PUT clears omitted optional fields. Email validation and case-insensitive uniqueness are enforced.\n- Validation responses use `{\"error\": \"...\", \"errors\": {\"field\": \"...\"}}`; invalid input 400, duplicates 409, missing customers 404, successful creation 201, deletion 204.\n- Exact duplicate-email message: `\"A customer with this email already exists.\"`\n- Search matches name/email/phone/company/notes and escapes LIKE wildcard characters; company is exact case-insensitive matching. Customer order: name `COLLATE NOCASE`, then ID.\n- API pagination defaults: page 1, page_size 20, allowed page_size 1–100. Frontend defaults to 10 with 10/20/50 options and URL-preserved filters/paging.\n- Interactions require `kind` (`call`, `email`, `meeting`) and summary. Optional `occurred_at` defaults to now, is normalized to UTC, and timezone-less input means UTC.\n- `logged_by` is the authenticated username, ignoring client-supplied values. Order: occurred_at descending, then ID descending. `last_contacted_at` is MAX occurrence time, not insertion time.\n- Additional authenticated frontend-support endpoints: `/api/auth/me`, `/api/auth/logout`, `/api/overview`.\n- Tailwind utility styling only; handwritten stylesheet is limited to Tailwind entry/theme. Design brand is “Commonplace,” with green/white auth screen, workspace sidebar, customer table, stats, profile, modal forms, and responsive layouts.\n- Provided internal package caches failed (502/unavailable). Installs succeeded with `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` and pip `--index-url https://pypi.org/simple`.\n- `backend/requirements.lock` changed to version-only constraints because original hashed constraints caused pip hash-mode errors.\n- No seeded accounts/customers. Changes are still unstaged/uncommitted.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Implemented SQLite schema, foreign-key cascade deletion, WAL mode, authenticated API, field validation, aggregates, session handling, frontend serving, and JSON API errors in `backend/app.py`.\n- Added security response headers and `Cache-Control: no-store` for API responses; request body limit is 128 KiB.\n- Implemented React routing/auth provider, sign-in/registration, account persistence/logout, customer listing and filters, customer add/edit/delete, detail view, interaction entry/history, API field errors, and notifications.\n- Mobile auth screen now hides the large desktop marketing panel; tests verify sign-in button fits viewport and profile has no horizontal overflow.\n- Added TypeScript configuration, ESLint configuration, Tailwind Vite integration, Lucide icons, React Router, and Playwright tests.\n- Updated README with development, Docker, verification, and API behavior documentation.\n- Updated `.gitignore`/`.dockerignore` to exclude data, caches, dependencies, generated builds, and test artifacts.\n- Backend verification passed:\n  - `python3 -m unittest backend.test_app -v`: 7 tests pass.\n  - `python3 -m ruff check backend`: passes.\n  - `python3 -m ruff format --check backend`: 2 files already formatted.\n  - `git diff --check`: passes.\n- Frontend verification passed after clean lockfile installation:\n  - `npm ci --no-audit --no-fund --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org`\n  - `npm run lint`\n  - `npm run typecheck`\n  - `npm run build`\n  - `npm audit --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org`: 0 vulnerabilities.\n- Fixed dev dependency minimatch advisory using package override: `@typescript-eslint/typescript-estree` → `minimatch: \"11.0.5\"`.\n- Two Playwright integration tests pass against production gunicorn on port 8001:\n  - Registration/login, required-field and duplicate-email errors, CRUD, search/company filtering, interactions, correct last-contacted time, reload persistence, mobile deletion/logout/access protection.\n  - Pagination, page-size changes, and URL-preserved company filter.\n- Browser download was blocked; temporary unsaved `@sparticuz/chromium` npm package supplied Chromium and libraries. Subsequent clean `npm ci` removed the temporary dependency; extracted browser remains under ignored `.cache/`.\n- Successful browser test command from `/workspace/frontend`:\n  - `TMPDIR=/workspace/.cache FONTCONFIG_PATH=/workspace/.cache/fontconfig LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/workspace/.cache/al2023/lib CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/workspace/.cache/chromium npm run test:e2e`\n- Screenshots generated under `/workspace/.cache/`: `login-desktop.png`, `customers-desktop.png`, `profile-desktop.png`, `profile-mobile.png`, `login-mobile.png`.\n\n### Active\n- Final review/documentation/status checks; last reads were `README.md` and `frontend/playwright.config.ts`.\n- Todo tracker still has final “Add and run API tests, frontend typecheck/lint/build, and review changes” item `in_progress`; other three items completed.\n\n### Blocked\n- Docker is unavailable: `docker --version` returned `/usr/bin/bash: line 1: docker: command not found`. Actual Docker image build/run has not been validated; production gunicorn browser tests passed instead.\n- Default Playwright download from `https://cdn.playwright.dev/...` returns 403 `egress_denied`; tests work with the extracted npm-supplied Chromium.\n- Screenshot files were read successfully, but assistant reported inability to visually inspect images in this session.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Finish final review with `git status --short`/`git diff --check` as needed; ensure new files and lockfiles remain intact, then mark final todo completed.\n2. Give a concise completion response summarizing features and passing API/lint/typecheck/build/browser tests; explicitly note Docker could not be run here.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: `create_app`, `get_db`, schema, authentication, all API endpoints, frontend serving, gunicorn module-level `app`.\n- `/workspace/backend/test_app.py`: seven unittest cases covering auth, validation/duplicates, search/paging, shared interactions, deletion cascade, persistence, and expiration.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`: unchanged production pins `flask==3.1.3`, `gunicorn==26.2.0`.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: plain pinned Flask/gunicorn transitive constraints.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements-dev.txt`: includes production requirements and `ruff==0.14.8`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: `AuthProvider`, `useAuth`, protected routes `/customers` and `/customers/:id`, `/login`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: API wrapper, token header, `ApiError`, models, timestamp/initial helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/AuthScreen.tsx`: login/registration and responsive branding.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/Layout.tsx`: navigation/account header/sidebar, workspace guide, notifications, `LayoutContext`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/Customers.tsx`: stats, paged table, URL filters, debounced search, empty/loading/error states.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/CustomerForm.tsx`: add/edit modal and API validation feedback.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/CustomerDetail.tsx`: customer profile, deletion confirmation, `InteractionForm`, history and last-contacted display.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/ui.tsx`: Tailwind control styles, `Logo`, `Spinner`, `Alert`, `Field`, native-dialog `Modal`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind import and brand/font theme only.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: pinned dependencies, minimatch override, scripts `dev`, `build`, `typecheck`, `lint`, `test:e2e`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: React/Tailwind plugins, `/api` proxy to `http://localhost:8000`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/eslint.config.js`: strict TypeScript and ESLint setup.\n- `/workspace/frontend/playwright.config.ts`: isolated gunicorn test server/database, optional `CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tests/directory.spec.ts`: two passing production-server browser integration tests.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: original multi-stage Node 24/Python 3.13 build and gunicorn port 8000 command; unchanged.\n- `/workspace/README.md`: operating instructions, verification commands, API decisions.\n- `/workspace/.gitignore`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: prevent inclusion of persistent data and generated artifacts.\n- `/workspace/.cache/fontconfig/fonts.conf`: ignored sandbox-only fontconfig needed for extracted Chromium.\n- `/workspace/frontend/dist/`: generated production build, ignored by git.","time":{"start":1794319707994,"end":1794319745568}}}
